From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:40:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: add SM4450 display support (DPU + MDSS + UBWC)

Inline rotation depends on the dpu_plane and dpu_rm fixes in the common
patch 0013-drm-msm-dpu-fix-inline-rotation.

[retroforge: rebased on our 0340, which already adds rotation_v201_formats (identical
list); only the SM4450 rotator cfg, VIG sblk, LM sblk and QoS table are added here.]
---
 .../msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_8_6_sm4450.h    | 162 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c    |  22 +++
 .../gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.h    |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_kms.c       |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_mdss.c                |   1 +
 drivers/soc/qcom/ubwc_config.c                |   1 +
 6 files changed, 188 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_8_6_sm4450.h

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_8_6_sm4450.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_8_6_sm4450.h
